{
  "name": "Autonomous Customer Onboarding Concierge",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. TRIGGERS\nFires the moment a client pays an invoice (Stripe) or signs a proposal (PandaDoc). Two independent entry points, normalized into one shape.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "1da303ed-f225-4136-a018-8678a7eb6885",
      "name": "Note: ## 1. TRIGGERS\nFires",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1920,
        464
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. STATE VERIFICATION\nChecks the payment/contract status. Only 'succeeded' events pass through. Flagged/partial payments are held and routed to Finance instead of being provisioned.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "8e1212aa-1391-4e88-99dd-07d6486e32e5",
      "name": "Note: ## 2. STATE VERIFICA",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1072,
        928
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. DEDUPE CHECK\nSearches Airtable for an existing client record by email before doing anything else — prevents duplicate boards/folders/channels if a webhook fires twice.",
        "height": 548,
        "width": 432,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "d6ce3246-5e9d-4a41-bab4-313ff1c424e6",
      "name": "Note: ## 3. DEDUPE CHECK\nS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -784,
        304
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. AUTO-PROVISIONING\nRuns in parallel: root folder + 3 standard subfolders, a cloned project board from a template, a private Slack channel, and the client is invited by email.",
        "height": 796,
        "width": 1360,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "5d117990-e0c7-42bc-82ef-b2fd16b73b6f",
      "name": "Note: ## 4. AUTO-PROVISION",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -224,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5. RECORD + NOTIFY\nWrites the new client + all generated links into Airtable (source of truth for future dedupe checks) and sends the branded onboarding email with everything the client needs.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "4f26372f-9903-4e7a-8a0d-215bf419fe5e",
      "name": "Note: ## 5. RECORD + NOTIF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1168,
        256
      ]
    },
